","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119168.patch","merged_at":"2026-05-05T15:33:51Z"},"body":"Right now, if you try to decompress ZSTD using `decompress_dynamic`, Godot will throw an error ```Condition \"p_mode != MODE_DEFLATE && p_mode != MODE_GZIP\" is true. Returning: (-1)```.\r\n\r\nIt's long, intimidating, and not obvious for developer what did they do wrong.\r\n\r\nWith this commit, trying to call `decompress_dynamic` with ZSTD compression will throw a more useful error `Dynamic decompression is only supported with gzip, DEFLATE, and Brotli compression methods.`\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nWhile documentation does mention that only gzip, DEFLATE, and Brotli are supported, it's possible that developer might not notice that, reuse existing code, or use code provided by an LLM.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/119168/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/11916